{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56620","headline":"唐镜铭 一 · 无名氏","name":"唐镜铭 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别日菱花出，临池满月生。\n官看巾帽整，妾映点（一作「美」）妆成。\n（见同治己巳广州刊林昌彞《海天琴思续录》卷二，云镜爲周南卿明经藏，「河东君物也。\n」此条承黄霖同志录示。\n又见王士伦编《浙江出土铜镜选集》序引，异文注出。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}